      "tr": "`import validators`, sonra `if validators.email(email):`.",
      "en": "`import validators`, then `if validators.email(email):`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport validators\n\nemail = input(\"Email: \").strip()\n\nif validators.email(email):\n    print(\"Valid\")\nelse:\n    print(\"Invalid\")\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport validators\n\nemail = input(\"Email: \").strip()\n\nif validators.email(email):\n    print(\"Valid\")\nelse:\n    print(\"Invalid\")\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "stdio",
      "cases": [
        {
